    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44800" root="&#xA;                        يقن&#xA;                    " body-key="Y1">
                        
                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَقِنَهُ</span></b> 
                        , (S, Msb, K,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَقِنَ بِهِ</span>; (Msb;)
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَيْقَنَهُ</span></b> , (S, K,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ايقن</span></b> ; (K;) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَيَقَّنَهُ</span></b> ; and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَيْقَنَهُ</span></b> , (S, Msb, K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استيقن</span></b> 
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ</span>; (K;) all signify the same; (S;) <i>He knew
it; he was,</i> or <i>became, certain,</i> or <i>sure,</i> or <i>he
made sure, of it;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلِمَهُ</span>; (Msb, K;)
<i>intuitively,</i> and <i>inferentially;</i> (Msb;) [see 1 in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">علم</span>;] and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحَقَقَّهُ</span>. (K.)

